<title>GERMANY: Volksfrsorge plans to raise capital.</title>
<headline>Volksfrsorge plans to raise capital.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>German insurer Volksfrsorge Holding AG said on Thursday it planned to increase its base capital by 22 million marks to 242 million marks through issuing bearer shares.</p>
<p>The insurer said the shares would be fully entitled to a 1997 dividend and would be issued to shareholders in the ratio one for 10 held.</p>
<p>- -Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
